1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Free markets are not a free-for-all.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Prices carry information that no central planner can gather.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,400
When demand rises, prices rise, and producers respond.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,800
Competition forces everyone to do better, cheaper, faster.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:20,000
But markets fail, so the state has to step in.
